  "title": "dot11decrypt: Increase decryption buffer size",
  "description": "IEEE 802.11ac increases maximum MPDU size to 11454 bytes and this\nis the same limit for 11ax and 11be. Increasing the buffer size\nwill make decrypting long A-MSDUs possible.\n\nReference: IEEE 802.11ax-2021, Table 9-25.\nReference: IEEE 802.11be Draft 1.5, Table 9-34.\nSigned-off-by: Chien Wong <m@xv97.com>\n\n\n(cherry picked from commit c281319dccd3bb0f3fe2e7181d0a1b63071571a4)\n\nCo-authored-by: Chien Wong <m@xv97.com>",
